# Electric Vehicle Analysis Dashboard (Power BI)

## Overview
Power BI dashboard analyzing **150,000+ electric vehicle records** from Washington State, USA.  
Provides insights into adoption trends, vehicle types, eligibility, and electric range performance.

## Dataset
- County, City, State, Postal Code  
- Make, Model, Model Year  
- Electric Vehicle Type (BEV, PHEV)  
- Electric Range, Base MSRP  
- CAFV Eligibility, Electric Utility  

## Dashboard Features
- **KPIs**: Total Vehicles, Average Electric Range  
- **Trend Analysis**: Vehicles by Model Year  
- **Distribution**: Top 10 Makes, Top 10 Models  
- **Eligibility**: CAFV Program Split (Eligible, Not Eligible)  
- **Vehicle Type**: BEV vs PHEV share  
- **Range Analysis**: Distribution of Vehicles by Electric Range  

## Files
- `Electric_Vehicle_Dashboard.pbix` → Power BI project file  
- `Electric_Vehicle_Dashboard.pdf` → Dashboard preview (quick view)  

## Tools
- Power BI (Data Modeling, DAX, Visualization)  

